Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snow, Revision, Star,\Nand Call, Star and Call.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:31.90,0:01:36.28,Title 3,ep,0,0,0,,{\fad(818,700)\pos(200,815)}Episode 17: The Lovers, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.69,0:01:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a nice bridge you make, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.39,0:01:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hang on, Jotaro, I\Nhave a very nasty itch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.35,0:02:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scratch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.47,0:02:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.93,0:02:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.39,0:02:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.17,0:02:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not too hard, mind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.79,0:02:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.71,0:02:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.53,0:02:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It honestly feels like\Nsomeone's tickling my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.13,0:02:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't concentrate much longer like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.47,0:02:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.35,0:02:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.67,0:02:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got quite the captive audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.51,0:02:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.77,0:02:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People are staring.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep this up and they'll\Nthink you've gone nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.11,0:02:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm screaming\Nfor the hell of it? No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That poor man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we give him some change?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.33,0:02:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they throwing money?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.41,0:02:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I pity them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old relatives like that can be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.25,0:03:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.85,0:03:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, go buy the TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.79,0:03:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of this crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.17,0:03:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this your store?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.73,0:03:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to buy that TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.35,0:03:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.27,0:03:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin's Hierophant and Polnareff's\NChariot Shrunk themselves
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to a microscopic level and\Ninfiltrated Joestar's body. They
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.89,0:03:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intend to fight me I can see them\Nthey're traveling through the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bloodstream And heading toward\Nthe brainstem right to my lovers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.77,0:03:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,quickly we don't have long\Nbefore the flesh but in mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.67,0:03:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar's brain eats Let's clean through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.45,0:03:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alley up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.19,0:03:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.11,0:03:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it, Mr. Chiba. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.53,0:03:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hermit Purple!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.31,0:04:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.47,0:04:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Flesh Bud's tentacles. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.77,0:04:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We finally made it to the brainstem,\Nbut the Flesh Bud's already taken over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.55,0:04:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.63,0:04:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at that fiend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.43,0:04:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's using those weird\Nclaws of his to knead Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.11,0:04:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar's brain cells into a gooey mash,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.21,0:04:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I bet he's going to\Nfeed it to the flesh bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.17,0:04:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to destroy him and tear out all\Nthe flesh bud's roots as fast as we can,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.01,0:04:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or else they'll completely\Ndevour his brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.51,0:04:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,D 'accord, I'll Jolyne him to rib it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.07,0:04:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, on second thought, I think\Na finer cut should do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.65,0:04:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll turn you into a lump of pate!
