Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.13,0:05:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.23,0:05:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.89,0:05:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, Kakyoin,\Nthat thing's pretty fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.99,0:05:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But luckily for us, I've\Nalready figured him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.25,0:05:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's all the little beast\Nhas, then he's no match for...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.71,0:05:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.63,0:05:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.29,0:05:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.81,0:05:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, that's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.95,0:05:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that wasn't the real stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.89,0:05:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's melting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.47,0:05:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the Lovers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.65,0:05:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold the wreath!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.59,0:05:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He disguised himself\Nusing the brain cells. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.85,0:05:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar's brain cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:05:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.03,0:06:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that thing was able to use\Nthe collection of needed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.79,0:06:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brain cells to disguise\Nhimself as my hierophant green.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.51,0:06:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since he can mold his cells at will,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.89,0:06:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all you destroyed was a decoy\Nmade of those brain cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.13,0:06:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hit the nail on the head, And\Nyou dummies completely fell for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.87,0:06:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.17,0:06:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull your head out of your ass, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.87,0:06:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better shine those\Nshoes right, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in such a good mood,\NI can hardly stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.55,0:06:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna need you to\Nkeep polishing these shoes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.13,0:06:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,until they're shining as\Nbrightly as I feel right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.01,0:06:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can handle\Nthat, my little sycophant?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.69,0:06:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can stop polishing\Nwhen that magnificent
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.77,0:06:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sun up in the sky makes\Nthese puppies sparkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.87,0:06:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, I want you to use\Nyour tongue to shine them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.45,0:06:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you writing in there?
