Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.44,0:07:01.69,SC17 Notebook,sign,0,0,0,,{=10}{\clip()\t(21,2231,\clip())\blur1\c&H766E6F&\fry6.16\frx1.64\frz13.94\fax0.06\move(8,844,675.37,846.74,21,2231)}Kicked in the face
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.59,0:07:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're looking at your tab.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.95,0:07:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're gonna pay in full.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.99,0:07:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wrote it down, so I won't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.85,0:07:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a scoundrel, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.05,0:07:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.01,0:07:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll all be meaningless in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.93,0:07:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.85,0:07:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.89,0:07:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check out the decoy's\Nhead that I just opened!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.11,0:07:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.09,0:07:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.79,0:07:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow he's splitting in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.35,0:07:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.55,0:07:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.91,0:07:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To win in life, one must\Nthoroughly know oneself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.83,0:07:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like Aesop's fables when the\Nunassuming tortoise beats the hare.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tortoise outruns the\Nhare because he knows
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:08:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,himself and his abilities\Nbetter than anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.33,0:08:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, the same applies to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.39,0:08:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm no fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.81,0:08:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know perfectly well I don't\Npossess the power or speed
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.59,0:08:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,necessary to mortally wound\Neither of you one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.13,0:08:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But remember this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The spoils belong to those who\Nadmit their own weaknesses!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.33,0:08:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emerald Splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.37,0:08:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More decoys are forming\Nout of the brain cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.59,0:08:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're multiplying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.83,0:08:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a person can have only one stand,\Nwhich means only one of them is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.83,0:08:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, where's the real one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.01,0:08:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.05,0:08:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.61,0:08:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emerald splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.11,0:08:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.59,0:09:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any closer and I would have been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.19,0:09:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more decoys we hit,\Nthe more they multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.35,0:09:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No! It's me! It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me! It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.53,0:09:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.19,0:09:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.10,0:09:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.67,0:09:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, that's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.23,0:09:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Withdraw your stand now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.95,0:09:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just watch you get hurt,\Neven if you are trying to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.13,0:09:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.61,0:09:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand the thought of giving\Nup and watching you die like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.19,0:09:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.95,0:09:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Withdraw your stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.33,0:09:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.55,0:09:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't quit, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.73,0:09:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chostar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.65,0:09:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll fight till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.83,0:09:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.53,0:09:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They all look the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.89,0:09:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one is the real one, and\Nwhich one of them is the stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.89,0:09:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell them apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.35,0:09:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world's biggest stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.07,0:09:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is the most
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.07,0:10:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.97,0:10:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, now, take a look at this, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.21,0:10:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would wager an expensive gift like this\Nwould make any girl fall head over heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.95,0:10:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, you see that\Nspace there in the glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your stand to sneak\Nthrough and steal the bracelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.73,0:10:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Steal it, what don't you understand,\Nmoron? Get a move on if you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.33,0:11:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know what's good for you i mean i\NDon't mind breaking the glass and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.73,0:11:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taking the bracelet myself then\Nagain if i'm caught i could Be
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.01,0:11:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beaten to a bloody pulp old Joseph\Nwould surely die from the pain
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.53,0:11:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.69,0:11:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it while the salesman's\Nlooking the other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.71,0:11:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is shoplifting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.07,0:11:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
