Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.51,0:11:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.79,0:11:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's shoplifting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.21,0:11:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, salesman!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.15,0:11:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go and get some help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.45,0:11:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.37,0:11:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:11:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.55,0:11:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's this thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.75,0:12:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the culprit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.89,0:12:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it that guy there? You're?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.79,0:12:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talking about that Asian kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.81,0:12:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, back where I come from,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.15,0:12:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when someone steals something,\Nwe chop their fingers off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.31,0:12:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro, you better not use\Nyour stand against civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.65,0:12:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,PUNKBALL!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.13,0:12:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.81,0:12:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despicable!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.73,0:12:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dirty thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you get the hell out of our\Ncountry and don't come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.75,0:12:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good for nothing, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.31,0:12:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do that, we'll allow you to\Nleave here with your fingers intact!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.67,0:12:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nicely done, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.47,0:12:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the commotion you caused,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.45,0:13:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was able to get my hands on something\Neven better than that bracelet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.35,0:13:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.79,0:13:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you laughing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.09,0:13:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so damn funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.15,0:13:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.85,0:13:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.83,0:13:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a bit excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.05,0:13:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was laughing because your\Npunishment has doubled,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.91,0:13:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I've been waiting a\Nwhile for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just about time for payback, and I\Ngotta say, it's really got me tingling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem that we have\Nsomething of a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.51,0:13:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to say, but your old\Nman isn't long for this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.13,0:13:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the reality you're facing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.43,0:13:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know us very\Nwell, do you, friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.29,0:13:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I see you don't know Kakyoin at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.31,0:13:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.41,0:13:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems to me you're obsessed\Nwith the notion of knowing oneself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.37,0:13:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.07,0:14:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'm inclined to agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.49,0:14:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before you continue pontificating,\Nthink on this for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.23,0:14:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's another adage, know thy\Nenemy, that's nothing to scoff at.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.53,0:14:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.69,0:14:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Hierophant has a certain ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.91,0:14:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has the power to\Nstretch out its feelers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.73,0:14:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I've been inspecting\Nevery single one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.25,0:14:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I have not noticed\Nsomething touching me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.63,0:14:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're the stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.29,0:14:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emerald, splash!
