Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Success!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.99,0:14:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, what do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.41,0:14:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Kakyoin got\Nyou pretty damn good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.53,0:14:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm wondering, will I get\Nmy payback once he's done?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.51,0:14:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He realized that he's\Nout of his league and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.85,0:15:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now he's trying to escape into the artery!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.47,0:15:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to escape from Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar's brain! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.99,0:15:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say he's leaving? All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.59,0:15:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great news, isn't it? Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.73,0:15:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, hurry! The Flesh Buds!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.67,0:15:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.73,0:15:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for overdrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.23,0:15:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Flesh Buds vanishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.49,0:15:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank God it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.69,0:15:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you ask me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.27,0:15:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this whole experience has done a lot\Nto bring our group closer together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.49,0:15:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're incorrigible, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.59,0:15:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that thing's really\Ntrying to leave my brain...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.25,0:15:45.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then wouldn't that imply\Nthat the stand is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.85,0:15:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bastard is returning to its user!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.19,0:15:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.17,0:15:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro has no way of knowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.41,0:16:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.33,0:16:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you backing away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.43,0:16:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to tell me more\Nabout my grandfather's death?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.81,0:16:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd really love to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.45,0:16:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with the big hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We weren't done talking yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.31,0:16:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! It couldn't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.69,0:16:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not actually trying\Nto run away, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.71,0:16:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.35,0:16:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Jotaro, sir, forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.23,0:16:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admitted you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.91,0:16:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll lie down and lick your boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.71,0:16:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I did a bad thing\Nand I want to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.57,0:16:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can pummel me as much as\Nyou'd like. Hit me. Kick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.67,0:16:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But please, don't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.07,0:16:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you to spare my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.15,0:16:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon, very soon, the\Nlovers will return to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.87,0:17:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this idiot Jotaro\Ndoesn't have a single clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.89,0:17:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.09,0:17:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time it'll enter your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.89,0:17:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakuin can't help you from\Nhundreds of meters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.91,0:17:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you suffer pain so horrible\Nyou'll wish you were never born.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.45,0:17:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.37,0:17:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.28,0:17:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, enter his ear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.49,0:17:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kinda figured you'd go and\Ntry something shitty like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.15,0:17:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know my Stanstar\NPlatinum possesses
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.79,0:17:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,excellent eyesight and precise reflexes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.43,0:17:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.49,0:17:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you check up on us\Nat all, even a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.85,0:17:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No no no no no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.53,0:17:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me I wasn't planning anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.39,0:17:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not against your stance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.11,0:17:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Immense power did you just say your stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only your let me explain what\NI meant to say is that your
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.73,0:18:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,awesome and powerful stand\Nis far superior to any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.03,0:18:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it didn't stand a\Nchance so I had it come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.07,0:18:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.59,0:18:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've already shattered\Nmy arm and leg to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.83,0:18:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't possibly fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.73,0:18:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.25,0:18:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, I guess\NI'll take pity on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.95,0:18:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And accept your arm and leg as payment!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.83,0:18:32.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for all the low blows\Nyou took out against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.41,0:18:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But only if you swear that you'll never\Nshow your ugly mug in front of us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.51,0:18:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever you say. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.69,0:18:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll head for some deserted island!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:41.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or I'll go to the ends of the earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.83,0:18:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and never return to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.51,0:18:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better not be lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.49,0:18:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next time I see that face,\Nit'll get a thousand punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.93,0:18:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.99,0:18:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would never, ever lie to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.51,0:18:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just hop her over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.11,0:19:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.37,0:19:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're an utter fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.73,0:19:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just take a look at that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.91,0:19:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might interest you\Nto know that my stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.37,0:19:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the lovers Just went into that girl's ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.57,0:19:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he's heading for her brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.45,0:19:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better not move, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.63,0:19:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's what's about to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.35,0:19:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna stab you in\Nthe back with this knife
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.61,0:19:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and make sure that you're\Nnever able to move again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack me with your star platinum and this
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.15,0:19:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,girl's pathetic life\Nends right here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.21,0:19:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you would never allow such an\Ninnocent child to die, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.87,0:19:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.45,0:19:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and stab me then. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.07,0:19:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, now, did you not hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.95,0:19:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just told you not to...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.73,0:20:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you not to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.33,0:20:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.03,0:20:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say something\Nabout stabbing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.63,0:20:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.45,0:20:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body won't move! What... why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.71,0:20:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.69,0:20:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what is this thing wrapped around me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.89,0:20:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you didn't notice, as your\Nstand was trying to make its escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.33,0:20:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin tied Hierophant's\Ntentacle to its leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.37,0:20:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And seeing as those\Ntentacles stretch all the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.83,0:20:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,way back to your stand\Nlike a string to a kite,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.65,0:20:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must have been so self-absorbed\Nyou didn't even notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.59,0:20:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm begging you, forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.39,0:20:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ask for forgiveness from\NEnya, the woman you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.67,0:21:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as for me, I never had the\Nslightest intention of forgiving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.07,0:21:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio paid me to cause this madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.69,0:21:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.29,0:21:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this is blatantly obvious,\Nbut you really are a piece of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.75,0:21:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you owe me, you can never\Neven pay back with money!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.29,0:21:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.57,0:21:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.79,0:21:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can keep the freakin' change.
