Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.67,0:22:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.10,0:22:15.56,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.47,0:22:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don't you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.56,0:22:17.81,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don'tcha know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.51,0:22:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you move too quick!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.81,0:22:19.27,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.07,0:22:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.06,0:22:22.52,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.17,0:22:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the birds are men by the Nile.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.52,0:22:24.86,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the bazaar men by the Nile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.83,0:22:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.86,0:22:27.20,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.89,0:22:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All crocodiles.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.20,0:22:28.70,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Gold crocodiles
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.49,0:22:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.36,0:22:31.83,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.47,0:22:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Falling tight to the hookah.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.83,0:22:34.04,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with their hookah pipes say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.47,0:22:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.04,0:22:43.59,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.47,0:22:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.97,0:22:57.43,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.43,0:22:59.81,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They spin around and they cross the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.45,0:22:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spin around and they cross the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.45,0:23:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.81,0:23:01.06,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.67,0:23:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink,\Nthen they bring you more.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.11,0:23:04.44,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then they bring you more
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.11,0:23:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.44,0:23:06.78,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.75,0:23:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're like the punk and the metal band.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.78,0:23:09.11,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They like the punk and the metal band
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.81,0:23:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.11,0:23:10.57,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.11,0:23:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.41,0:23:13.74,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.07,0:23:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.74,0:23:15.95,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.71,0:23:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.67,0:23:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.08,0:23:26.17,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.79,0:23:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an Egyptian.
