Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.89,0:23:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't shake the feeling\Nthat there's someone out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.75,0:23:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.67,0:23:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you might\Nbe worrying a bit too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.99,0:23:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he's on to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.27,0:23:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel some sort of presence too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.89,0:23:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still haven't been able to shake the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.33,0:23:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feeling that someone out\Nthere is watching us.
